@startuml

title ShikigamiApp Scenario Runner - Automation Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
left to right direction

package "Automation" {
class GuiSession

package "Definition" {
class AutomationIds <<static>>
}

package "Layout" {
class ScenarioWindowLayout {
+ WindowBounds RunnerBounds
+ WindowBounds MonitorBounds
+ WindowBounds GuiBounds
}
}

package "Model" {
class WindowBounds {
+ int X
+ int Y
+ int Width
+ int Height
}

class WindowFrameInfo {
+ WindowBounds WindowBounds
+ WindowBounds DwmFrameBounds
+ WindowBounds ClientBounds
+ WindowFrameInsets InvisibleFrame
+ int WindowBorderWidth
+ int WindowBorderHeight
}

class WindowFrameInsets {
+ int Left
+ int Top
+ int Right
+ int Bottom
}
}

package "Interop" {
class WindowFrameHelper <<static>>
}

package "Operator" {
class WindowOperator
class GuiOperator
class ButtonOperator
class ComboBoxOperator
class TextBoxOperator
class DialogOperator
class FileDialogOperator
class InputOperator
class ShikigamiOperator
class MitamaOperator
class CalculationOperator
class ShikigamiDataOperator
class ShikigamiDataFileOperator
class ShikigamiRecoveryOperator
}

package "Waiter" {
class WindowWaiter
class ShikigamiDataWaiter
}

package "Watcher" {
class ShikigamiDataFileWatcher
}
}

package "Execution" {
class ScenarioCommandExecutor
class ScenarioExecutonContext
}

package "External" {
class "FlaUI" as FlaUI <<library>>
class "Win32 API" as Win32 <<library>>
}

' ========================================
' Layout / Window
' ========================================
ScenarioWindowLayout --> WindowBounds

WindowFrameInfo *-- WindowBounds
WindowFrameInfo *-- WindowFrameInsets

WindowFrameHelper ..> WindowBounds
WindowFrameHelper ..> WindowFrameInfo
WindowFrameHelper ..> WindowFrameInsets
WindowFrameHelper ..> Win32

WindowOperator ..> FlaUI
WindowWaiter ..> FlaUI

' ========================================
' GUI
' ========================================
GuiOperator --> WindowOperator
GuiOperator --> WindowWaiter
GuiOperator ..> GuiSession
GuiOperator ..> AutomationIds
GuiOperator ..> FlaUI

GuiSession ..> FlaUI

' ========================================
' Basic controls
' ========================================
ButtonOperator ..> FlaUI
ComboBoxOperator ..> FlaUI
ComboBoxOperator ..> Win32
TextBoxOperator ..> FlaUI
DialogOperator ..> FlaUI
FileDialogOperator ..> FlaUI

' ========================================
' Input
' ========================================
InputOperator --> ButtonOperator
InputOperator --> ComboBoxOperator
InputOperator --> TextBoxOperator
InputOperator --> DialogOperator
InputOperator --> GuiOperator
InputOperator ..> AutomationIds

' ========================================
' Shikigami
' ========================================
ShikigamiOperator --> ButtonOperator
ShikigamiOperator --> ComboBoxOperator
ShikigamiOperator --> DialogOperator
ShikigamiOperator --> GuiOperator
ShikigamiOperator --> WindowWaiter
ShikigamiOperator ..> AutomationIds

' ========================================
' Mitama
' ========================================
MitamaOperator --> ButtonOperator
MitamaOperator --> ComboBoxOperator
MitamaOperator --> FileDialogOperator
MitamaOperator --> GuiOperator
MitamaOperator --> WindowWaiter
MitamaOperator ..> AutomationIds

' ========================================
' Calculation
' ========================================
CalculationOperator ..> FlaUI

' ========================================
' Shikigami data
' ========================================
ShikigamiDataOperator --> ShikigamiDataFileOperator
ShikigamiDataOperator --> ShikigamiOperator

ShikigamiRecoveryOperator --> ButtonOperator
ShikigamiRecoveryOperator --> FileDialogOperator
ShikigamiRecoveryOperator --> GuiOperator
ShikigamiRecoveryOperator --> WindowWaiter
ShikigamiRecoveryOperator ..> AutomationIds
ShikigamiRecoveryOperator ..> FlaUI

' ========================================
' Execution boundary
' ========================================
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> GuiOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> InputOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> MitamaOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> CalculationOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiDataOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiRecoveryOperator
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> WindowWaiter
ScenarioCommandExecutor --> ShikigamiDataWaiter

ShikigamiDataWaiter --> ScenarioExecutonContext

note bottom of WindowFrameHelper
Win32 / DWM からウィンドウフレーム情報を取得し、
不可視フレームを考慮した座標計算を行う。
end note

note bottom of ScenarioCommandExecutor
Execution 層と Automation 層の境界。

ScenarioCommandExecutor は処理を振り分け、
具体的な GUI 操作は各 Operator / Waiter が担当する。
end note

@enduml
